# Project isolation — smart meters only

This repository is **Smart Meters Platform only**.

## Forbidden

- Do **not** add schemas, migrations, apps, packages, env keys, storage buckets, or docs from other products here (especially Daily Checklists / قوائم الفحص).
- Do **not** share this project's Supabase (`iqcxgtpcfhoapnklxdyl` or any meters project) with another product.
- Do **not** seed other-product organizations/sites into this database.
- Do **not** copy or symlink code from `daily-checklists-flutter` (or any sibling project) into this repo.

## Other products

Work on Daily Checklists and similar apps only in their own repos (e.g. `~/Downloads/daily-checklists-flutter`) with their own Supabase project.

## If contamination is found

1. Remove foreign files from this repo.
2. Drop foreign DB objects/buckets from meters Staging/Production.
3. Point the other product at its own backend — never reverse-share meters credentials.
